            "review_title": "Review at Bia hơi Hà Nội - Lẩu cua đồng",
            "review_text": "Rob Nesbit\nWarsaw, Poland6919 contributions\n0\nThumbs up for good street food.\nSep 2022\nBoth of us were dead hungry, after a belly full of beer, and not so full after the disappointment of the kebab place, sat down here and ordered as much meat as we could!!!\nFriendly service, food was served fast and well delicious, washed down with beer, yes even more beer!\nSimple dishes, nothing fancy, but did the business for two hungry souls on a night out on the town.\nThumbs up for good street food.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten September 29, 2022",
